__7_hUNq__citationIcon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v16"></path><path d="M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z"></path></svg></div><p class="MapExplorer-module__7_hUNq__citationEyebrow">Morocco GeoHub · Research data</p><h2 id="citation-title">Please cite the data</h2><p id="citation-description" class="MapExplorer-module__7_hUNq__citationDescription">The datasets available through Morocco GeoHub are derived from scientific research and associated publications. If you use this dataset in research, reports, presentations, or other work, please cite the corresponding scientific publication and acknowledge Morocco GeoHub.</p><div id="citation-help" class="MapExplorer-module__7_hUNq__citationHelp"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><p>You can find the associated publication and citation details by clicking<!-- --> “<strong>View Related Publication</strong>” <!-- -->in the dataset information panel.</p></div><button type="button" class="MapExplorer-module__7_hUNq__citationConfirm">OK</button></dialog><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer"><div class="Footer-module__Grjkva__container"><div class="Footer-module__Grjkva__brandColumn"><a class="Footer-module__Grjkva__logoBox" aria-label="Morocco GeoHub home" href="/"><img alt="Morocco GeoHub" loading="lazy" width="5197" height="5197" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="Footer-module__Grjkva__logoIma